{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleNotEnoughDescribeDayBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleNotEnoughDescribeDayBody", "text": "Every point here is the middle of the same day across two or more of your own cycles. Nothing has two behind it yet.", "sha256": "5d9535954d9d2e7310b8006048bb04d47e0b86cad0b3e902e14f84a8d2bb80fb", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleOwnPastCyclesDescribed", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleOwnPastCyclesDescribed", "text": "Your own past cycles, described. Days that only one cycle reached are left empty rather than drawn — one night is not a middle. It describes what happened, not what will.", "sha256": "6f40a7e68fec4f01d26c882ab83bb9a5c0ae6af060383ff2815d650d2fed88b9", "kind": "arb"}
