{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleCompareBodyGeneric", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleCompareBodyGeneric", "text": "This puts today next to the same day of your own previous cycles. It needs three of them that got that far.", "sha256": "ad2afcac592a23e92a3e035fc17b025754bf4d7a1bd6dd263abadcb9f1479086", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleCompareBodyWithDay", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleCompareBodyWithDay", "text": "This puts today next to the same day of your own previous cycles. It needs three of them that reached day {day}.", "sha256": "2b701d1beb4f3a10b550eae2c3eed5c4781a67a4e6fdecbe4e0093fd44bded0a", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleNightOfLabel", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleNightOfLabel", "text": "NIGHT OF {date}", "sha256": "bace10516d4220ff1f22f86de59f804ec908f2cd8214da6b51ee001a62d2a875", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleComparisonNotCorrection", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleComparisonNotCorrection", "text": "A comparison, not a correction. Nothing on your readiness has been rescaled by this, and nothing here is a training instruction.", "sha256": "1dfba5150c7869467a4974f48bded25e327b097caee8d9b194b18d8ef7f8ce41", "kind": "arb"}
