{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleCompareLine", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleCompareLine", "text": "{label} {z1} vs your last 3 weeks, {z2} vs your last {n} day-{cycleDay}s.", "sha256": "5dfc6d620146e709fe103c8603015796c080b059c0650d47880df78f179e28a1", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleLengthsTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleLengthsTitle", "text": "Your cycle lengths against a published range", "sha256": "d3bcc72ed249c8895fddea29f1b1c88b9f91a5762398bf7db702b989d9b6647b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleLengthsBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleLengthsBody", "text": "Off unless you ask for it. It draws the days between your own logged starts next to the range published for an adult cycle, and says nothing else about them.", "sha256": "24d0733f8a4e8e114ca440f3a0b9c2fd00a25d7700581feaace7038d78784c3f", "kind": "arb"}
