{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleNotEnoughLoggedTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleNotEnoughLoggedTitle", "text": "Not enough logged cycles yet", "sha256": "5af732042e4cd59c07cdd083738f5cdce348013b6bdf1dbefbb55c79c4305192", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleNotEnoughLoggedBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleNotEnoughLoggedBody", "text": "This needs a long run: {n} of {total} gaps so far, which is about a year of logging every start.", "sha256": "144eddb7f38c1662f880fc0eaafdd61b2de331c9f9cc25349a0db3bafc914fa3", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleGapTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleGapTitle", "text": "There is a gap in your logged starts", "sha256": "261addaee1330692f54acebb59883c09221f9ecaf70d3e20e9688fd66901817c", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleGapBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleGapBody", "text": "One of them is more than {days} days after the one before it. A start you never logged and a cycle that genuinely ran that long look the same from here, so nothing is drawn.", "sha256": "4f6f17cb98015f4d0aac3def7e2f691e2952087748f8f0edacfe4387ff550160", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleDaysBetweenStarts", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleDaysBetweenStarts", "text": "Days between your logged starts", "sha256": "4111cb24296e6224cc69f8bc2d8e66501f43446b6ca42ee544abd0eeab24629b", "kind": "arb"}
