{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleMdcNoteInsideSpread", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleMdcNoteInsideSpread", "text": " Every day drawn here is inside your own night-to-night spread: the biggest gap between two of them is {s}, and {n} is the smallest change this can tell from noise. A shape, not a shift.", "sha256": "579232c55fe82cab8136c7cd8d80faabb97e0ae4d166c94fa41b9264db5be28e", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:cycleMdcNoteVaries", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "cycleMdcNoteVaries", "text": " Your nights vary by {n} on their own, so days closer together than that are not separated. The biggest gap here is {s}.", "sha256": "acc417f5a89b93fb89a94c5e8511c4812c56079b1a6a428a208d2aa8ba00a446", "kind": "arb"}
